{
  "format": "spreadsheet-app",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Freelancer Invoicing & Payment Follow-up",
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Invoice desk",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Invoice instructions",
          "source": "# Invoice desk\n\nChoose a client with unbilled work, enter an invoice ID and dates, and review the line-item preview. **Issue invoice** copies each matching work entry with its hours and agreed rate, then stores the invoice header. New entries for that client remain available for a later invoice.\n\nThe example has both an overdue partial payment and a newer open balance. Try issuing invoice **INV-2026-104** for Lantern Studio to freeze its October accessibility review. Then open the Invoices page to see the captured total."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "name": "InvoiceForm",
          "rowCount": 6,
          "colCount": 3,
          "cells": [
            {
              "row": 0,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "Client"
            },
            {
              "row": 0,
              "col": 2,
              "input": "=DROPDOWN('Records'!Clients[Client],B1)"
            },
            {
              "row": 1,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "Invoice ID"
            },
            {
              "row": 1,
              "col": 1,
              "input": "INV-2026-104"
            },
            {
              "row": 2,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "Issue date"
            },
            {
              "row": 2,
              "col": 1,
              "input": "2026-10-04"
            },
            {
              "row": 3,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "Due date"
            },
            {
              "row": 3,
              "col": 1,
              "input": "2026-10-18"
            },
            {
              "row": 5,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "Issue selected work"
            },
            {
              "row": 5,
              "col": 1,
              "input": "=IF(OR(B1=\"\",B2=\"\",B3=\"\",B4=\"\",COUNTIFS('Records'!WorkLog[Client],B1,'Records'!WorkLog[InvoiceStatus],\"Unbilled\")=0),\"Select a client with unbilled work and complete the invoice fields\",BUTTON(\"Issue invoice\",DO(INSERT(FILTER(HSTACK('Records'!WorkLog[WorkID],'Records'!WorkLog[Date],'Records'!WorkLog[Description],'Records'!WorkLog[Hours],'Records'!WorkLog[Rate],'Records'!WorkLog[LineTotal],MAP('Records'!WorkLog[WorkID],LAMBDA(work,B2))),('Records'!WorkLog[Client]=B1)*('Records'!WorkLog[InvoiceStatus]=\"Unbilled\")),'Records'!InvoiceLines!A:G),APPEND_ROW('Records'!Invoices!A:D,B2,B1,B3,B4),CLEAR(B1),CLEAR(B2))))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Invoice preview",
          "source": "## Unbilled work for the selected client\n\n{% if InvoiceForm!B1 = \"\" %}\nChoose a client to preview unbilled work.\n{% else %}\n{% let unbilled = COUNTIFS('Records'!WorkLog[Client],InvoiceForm!B1,'Records'!WorkLog[InvoiceStatus],\"Unbilled\") %}\n{% if unbilled = 0 %}\nThis client has no unbilled work.\n{% else %}\n{{ FILTER(HSTACK('Records'!WorkLog[Date],'Records'!WorkLog[Description],'Records'!WorkLog[Hours],'Records'!WorkLog[Rate],'Records'!WorkLog[LineTotal]),('Records'!WorkLog[Client]=InvoiceForm!B1)*('Records'!WorkLog[InvoiceStatus]=\"Unbilled\")) }}\n\n**Preview total:** {{ TEXT(SUMIFS('Records'!WorkLog[LineTotal],'Records'!WorkLog[Client],InvoiceForm!B1,'Records'!WorkLog[InvoiceStatus],\"Unbilled\"), \"$#,##0.00\") }}.\n{% end %}\n{% end %}"
        },
