          "type": "text",
          "name": "Accounts receivable",
          "source": "# Payment follow-up\n\n{% let open = SUM('Records'!Invoices[Balance]) %}\n**Open receivables:** {{ TEXT(open, \"$#,##0.00\") }}. Review overdue invoices first, then contact the client before the next due date.\n\n{{ FILTER(HSTACK('Records'!Invoices[InvoiceID],'Records'!Invoices[Client],'Records'!Invoices[DueDate],'Records'!Invoices[Balance],'Records'!Invoices[Status]),'Records'!Invoices[Balance]>0) }}\n\nUse the payment form to record a received installment. The invoice balance and status update from the payment ledger."
        },
